# Allowlist: the build only needs the Go module and the entrypoint. Anything
# else in the checkout (a config.yaml, history.db, an eraser-backup.tgz from
# docs/docker.md, screenshots, logs) never reaches the build context.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!data/
!docker/

# Personal data that could sit inside an allowed directory
**/config.yaml
**/*.local.yaml
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.bak
**/*.backup
**/*.orig
**/*.log
**/*.tgz
**/screenshots/
**/browser-data/
**/eraser-evidence-*
